    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Decks you build focus on variety at the expense of large effects.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Cartomancy class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When building an active deck, you may choose to reduce the number of lesser portents in the deck by 1. If you do, the number of least portents in that deck is increased by +3.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
